                "metadata": {
                    "note": "Marketplace",
                    "author": "Little Woolly Vision",
                    "category": "music",
                    "description": "Get ready for a joyful journey through some of the most loved nursery rhymes and animal songs, each with an original twist and playful charm from Little Woolly Vision’s hit stop motion animations—enjoyed by millions on YouTube! This Yoto Card features fun, reimagined versions of classics like “Jump Jump Went the Little Green Frog,” “Hickory Dickory Dock,” and more. Meet a fresh take on a familiar favourite as Old MacDonald is now a woman, and find out what happens when Incy Wincy spider sails the seven seas. With music performed by Gemma Storr, Steve Pretty, and Ed Hartwell, these catchy tunes are perfect for singing, dancing, and giggling along. A delightful addition to playtime, car journeys, or winding down before bed.",
